<title>INDIA: India's Century Enka 1996/97 results.</title>
<headline>India's Century Enka 1996/97 results.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     310.68   vs    246.93</p>
<p>    Turnover	     5,345.56   vs  6,039.29</p>
<p>    Gross Profit	   648.37   vs    661.79</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   167.54   vs    193.91</p>
<p>    Tax			170.15   vs    220.96</p>
<p>    Balance brought	195.73   vs    157.97</p>
<p>forward from the</p>
<p>previous year</p>
<p>    Balance carried	195.48   vs    195.73</p>
<p>forward to next year</p>
<p>Note: Synthetic textiles maker Century Enka Limited said it maintained a dividend of 45 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91-22-265 9000)</p>
</text>
